OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA ridge of
OL,6,Fhigh pressure will topple across
OL,7,Fbringing a mostly dry night with clear
OL,8,Fspells, though the odd shower cannot
OL,9,Fbe ruled out further north. Turning
OL,10,Fchilly in rural areas. However, some
OL,11,Fcloud arriving from the west later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FEarly bright spells will
OL,14,Fgive way to increasing cloud from the
OL,15,Fwest on Thursday morning, and this
OL,16,Fwill lead into a wet and quite
OL,17,Fblustery afternoon. Some heavy rain
OL,18,Fdeveloping.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
